  "response": "인라인 선택 토글을 handleSelectionToggle 핸들러로 분리하고 React handler 타입, functional updater, 렌더 시점 파생 계산을 적용한 가상 패치다. navigation과 styling은 변경하지 않았다.",
  "virtualPatch": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/routes/entries/page.tsx",
        "beforeState": "present",
        "beforeSha256": "sha256:1db519f16f8b3708846dc5187357527cf27a91923ac9d72752d31ac1641c030a",
        "afterState": "present",
        "after": "import type {MouseEventHandler} from \"react\";\nimport {useState} from \"react\";\n\ninterface Entry {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n}\n\nexport const EntriesPage = ({entries}: {entries: Entry[]}) => {\n  const [selectedIds, setSelectedIds] = useState<string[]>([]);\n\n  /**\n   * @event 항목 선택 상태 전환\n   */\n  const handleSelectionToggle =\n    (entryId: string): MouseEventHandler<HTMLButtonElement> =>\n    (_event) => {\n      setSelectedIds((currentSelectedIds) =>\n        currentSelectedIds.includes(entryId)\n          ? currentSelectedIds.filter((selectedId) => selectedId !== entryId)\n          : [...currentSelectedIds, entryId],\n      );\n    };\n\n  const selectedCount = selectedIds.length;\n  const hasSelection = selectedCount > 0;\n\n  return (\n    <section>\n      <p>{hasSelection ? `${selectedCount} selected` : \"No selection\"}</p>\n      {entries.map((entry) => (\n        <button\n          key={entry.id}\n          onClick={handleSelectionToggle(entry.id)}\n        >\n          {entry.label}\n        </button>\n      ))}\n    </section>\n  );\n};\n",
        "afterSha256": "sha256:d303c004e576315d5eb08dbb6fb27b2b492668c93d8f7e720cc4d7230ea13645"
      }
    ],
    "summary": "선택 toggle을 명명된 curried handler로 옮기고 functional updater를 적용했으며 effect 기반 파생 state를 render 계산으로 대체했다."
  }
